msgid "Installing ASUS ZenBook Linux Tools %s."
msgstr "Instalación de ASUS ZenBook Linux Tools %s."

#: lib/install-selection.sh:165
msgid ""
"Installs the WMI hotkey daemon for ScreenPad brightness, fan Quiet/Balanced/"
"Performance, camera privacy, and window swap across monitors."
msgstr ""
"Instala o demo de teclas rápidas WMI para o brillo do ScreenPad, o "
"ventilador Quiet/Balanced/Performance, a privacidade da cámara e o "
"intercambio de xanelas entre monitores."

#: lib/install-selection.sh:169
msgid ""
"Installs the speaker amplifier fix and a suspend/resume hook so supported "
"ZenBook audio recovers after boot and after sleep."
msgstr ""
"Instala a corrección do amplificador dos altofalantes e un gancho de "
"suspensión/reanudación para que o audio ZenBook compatible se recupere tras "
"o arranque e tras a suspensión."

#: lib/install-selection.sh:167
msgid ""
"Installs the touchpad Share gesture listener so a top-left corner tap opens "
"your desktop screenshot tool (GNOME, Spectacle, and peers)."
msgstr ""
"Instala o listener do xesto Share do touchpad para que un toque no canto "
"superior esquerdo abra a ferramenta de captura do escritorio (GNOME, "
"Spectacle e similares)."

#: lib/install-selection.sh:193
#, sh-format
